<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>E-Rezept App Documentation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007AFF, #5856D6);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.2);
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .version {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .modules-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .module-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 32px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid #e5e5e7;
        }
        .module-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            border-color: #007AFF;
        }
        .module-card h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #007AFF;
        }
        .module-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .category {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            color: #1d1d1f;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #007AFF;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            padding-top: 12px;
        }
        .category h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            color: #1d1d1f;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #007AFF;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 80px;
            padding: 40px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        .footer p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>E-Rezept-App iOS Documentation</h1>
        <p>Documentation for the German E-Prescription iOS application</p>
        <div class="version">Version <%= version %></div>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>Error Documentation</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: #666;">Comprehensive error handling and error code documentation</p>
        <div class="modules-grid">
            <a href="errors/error_details.html" class="module-card">
                <h3>Error Details</h3>
                <p>In-depth information about specific error codes and their causes</p>
            </a>
            <a href="errors/error_search.html" class="module-card">
                <h3>Error Search</h3>
                <p>Interactive search interface for finding specific error codes and descriptions</p>
            </a>
            <a href="errors/error_graph.html" class="module-card">
                <h3>Error Graph</h3>
                <p>Visual representation of error relationships and dependencies between modules</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>Technical Documentation</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: #666;">Documentation of the projects components and architecture</p>
        <div class="modules-grid">
            <a href="./technical/documentation/" class="module-card">
                <h3>Modules</h3>
                <p>Overview of the different modules within the project and their responsibilities</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>Security & Audits</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: #666;">Documentation related to security measures and audit processes</p>
        <div class="modules-grid">
            <a href="./sbom.json" class="module-card">
                <h3>SBOM</h3>
                <p>Detailed information about the Software Bill of Materials as cyclonedx json format.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="./requirements/requirements_filtered.html" class="module-card">
                <h3>Requirements</h3>
                <p>Detailed information about the requirements and dependencies of the project.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p><strong>E-Rezept App</strong> - German Electronic Prescription Application</p>
        <p>Generated on <%= Time.now.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %> | Version <%= version %></p>
        <p>© gematik GmbH - Licensed under EUPL 1.2</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>